{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Desktop Fidget is a fun and interactive desktop toybox filled with quirky virtual fidgets. It\u2019s designed to sit alongside your everyday workflow or gaming session, turning your desktop into a space where creativity meets playful distraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.poster.avif?t=1752118859\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.webm?t=1752118859\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.mp4?t=1752118859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/a3f2ead2780d3527bb390f23985661b0.avif?t=1752118859\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feeling tense? Just click, drag, spin, or mash your favorite fidgets to blow off steam. Every tap is oddly satisfying, like popping bubble wrap, but better. These small actions help keep your hands active and your mind calm during long hours at the computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/4de0ba3f276b59f9ad4c054f6563e774.poster.avif?t=1752118859\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/4de0ba3f276b59f9ad4c054f6563e774.webm?t=1752118859\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/4de0ba3f276b59f9ad4c054f6563e774.mp4?t=1752118859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/d500bb68cfbd689962389e8ec87c49e0.avif?t=1752118859\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These fidgets aren't just for show, they react to you. Blow into your mic to inflate a virtual bag, or connect your camera to turn a fidget into a goofy mirror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/7d51411de657f328beff58fb1ebea1d8.poster.avif?t=1752118859\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/7d51411de657f328beff58fb1ebea1d8.webm?t=1752118859\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/7d51411de657f328beff58fb1ebea1d8.mp4?t=1752118859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/4302078ffc2176636232a1669a9e2b28.avif?t=1752118859\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resize, move, and arrange your fidgets however you like. Create your own personal chaos, or harmony right on your screen. It\u2019s your space. Make it fidget-worthy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/fa177fa9878093a568a8e584d6be06ea.poster.avif?t=1752118859\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/fa177fa9878093a568a8e584d6be06ea.webm?t=1752118859\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/fa177fa9878093a568a8e584d6be06ea.mp4?t=1752118859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/762f2253ef0ca281f25742f50ae4cb05.avif?t=1752118859\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo Version:</strong> Includes <strong>7 sample fidgets</strong> to try out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full Release:</strong> Features <strong>20 fidgets</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Post-Release Content:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Free Pixel Asset Pack</strong> \u2013 Expand your creativity with extra visual assets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fidget DLC Pack</strong> \u2013 Add 10 brand-new fidgets to your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Access to the custom <strong>Fidget Workshop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/a507c0c29199fa23c38391d0e9a6c6fa.avif?t=1752118859\" data-has-big /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864560?t=1752118859","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/fbe03aa9e01c52f498584803dd63833b4832918f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752118859","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/300dfd97d46b6eefe77ca38e46b0a0b0f61a6a72/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752118859","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/300dfd97d46b6eefe77ca38e46b0a0b0f61a6a72/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752118859","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Desktop Fidget is a fun and interactive desktop toybox filled with quirky virtual fidgets. It\u2019s designed to sit alongside your everyday workflow or gaming session, turning your desktop into a space where creativity meets playful distraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.poster.avif?t=1752118859\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.webm?t=1752118859\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/fe3b76e92228f34b9dfef5ffbdd6b36d.mp4?t=1752118859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/a3f2ead2780d3527bb390f23985661b0.avif?t=1752118859\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feeling tense? Just click, drag, spin, or mash your favorite fidgets to blow off steam. Every tap is oddly satisfying, like popping bubble wrap, but better. These small actions help keep your hands active and your mind calm during long hours at the computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/4de0ba3f276b59f9ad4c054f6563e774.poster.avif?t=1752118859\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/4de0ba3f276b59f9ad4c054f6563e774.webm?t=1752118859\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/4de0ba3f276b59f9ad4c054f6563e774.mp4?t=1752118859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/d500bb68cfbd689962389e8ec87c49e0.avif?t=1752118859\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These fidgets aren't just for show, they react to you. Blow into your mic to inflate a virtual bag, or connect your camera to turn a fidget into a goofy mirror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/7d51411de657f328beff58fb1ebea1d8.poster.avif?t=1752118859\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/7d51411de657f328beff58fb1ebea1d8.webm?t=1752118859\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/7d51411de657f328beff58fb1ebea1d8.mp4?t=1752118859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/4302078ffc2176636232a1669a9e2b28.avif?t=1752118859\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resize, move, and arrange your fidgets however you like. Create your own personal chaos, or harmony right on your screen. It\u2019s your space. Make it fidget-worthy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864560/extras/fa177fa9878093a568a8e584d6be06ea.poster